  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 4757 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 00597035556 lists Boehringer Ingelheim Pharma GmbH & Co. KG (FEI 3002806556) as a registered plant for API manufacture, labeling, manufacturing, and packing.",
      "cites": ["E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 808119 of that plant ended on 2012-11-12 and was classified OAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2013-02-10.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 4757 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was subsequently issued to the same plant on 2013-05-06.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2014, 2016, 2018, 2021, and 2025 were classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label also names Bidachem S.p.A. (FEI 3002806598) for analysis and API manufacture, with its most recent inspection classified VAI on 2024-05-17.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East, Corvale General, and Corvale Lakeside hold 22, 24, and 20 days of supply respectively at current usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
